WEBVTT

00:00:00.114 --> 00:00:05.058
This video shows how a parent applies for leave for a child on a phone.

00:00:06.738 --> 00:00:13.266
Tap the menu button and choose Leave Requests. The Apply for Leave tab opens first.

00:00:20.592 --> 00:00:28.824
Choose the child from the list, then enter the start date and the end date. The page shows the duration, here one day.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:50.422
Write the reason for the leave. A link to a supporting document is optional.

00:01:03.661 --> 00:01:10.309
Tap Submit Leave Request. A green message confirms the request was sent to the school.

00:01:17.969 --> 00:01:28.793
Open My Requests. Your new request is Pending and has a Cancel Request button. An earlier request shows the school's decision and its remark.

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:42.512
Your request is with the school. You can cancel it while it is still pending.
